because you got dumped?

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:56.230
<i>Swim through life and grasp the success</i>

00:16:53.140 --> 00:16:54.820
Not my problem. That's stupid.

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:56.820
Be safe, Nyantaro!

