00:21:27.960 --> 00:21:31.060
<i>Thinking of the days long gone</i>

00:21:32.160 --> 00:21:34.100
<i>Stand by me</i>

00:21:34.100 --> 00:21:36.820
<i>Please</i>

00:21:37.160 --> 00:21:42.320
<i>I don't know if I can become stronger</i>

00:21:43.340 --> 00:21:47.800
<i>Even if you aren't here now</i>

00:21:49.000 --> 00:21:53.600
<i>Please give me the courage to reach out</i>

00:21:54.300 --> 00:21:56.660
<i>Stand by you</i>

00:21:56.660 --> 00:21:59.680
<i>Please</i>

