00:22:11.380 --> 00:22:17.140
<i>I just want to be embraced by your warmth</i>

00:22:19.150 --> 00:22:21.150
Mission complete.

00:22:21.720 --> 00:22:24.660
<i>It's Nyantaro! He's safe!</i>

00:22:24.660 --> 00:22:28.150
<i>I knew your selfies would bring me happiness.</i>

00:22:28.470 --> 00:22:29.800
<b>Thank you</b>

00:22:28.870 --> 00:22:30.460
Thank goodness.

